              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "eeyorelav"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I swapped out the cucumber, which I don’t care for, for mini sweet peppers and added canned artichoke 1/4s. Thickened the juice from canned pineapple with the lime. Just the right touch of sweetness. I love anything that’s fruity.",
