              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "shelbell1014"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My two kids were skeptical of this while I was quickly putting this together to accompany pork carnitas, but it turned out to be their favorite part of the meal! Had to omit hot peppers because of kid’s delicate tongues but added cilantro. Will definitely make this again. Yummy!",
